# File .bat phai giu CRLF NGAY TRONG BLOB cua git, khong chi o thu muc lam viec.
#
# Ly do 1: cmd.exe chay sai file .bat chi co LF (nuot ky tu dau dong, hong
#          cac khoi if/goto nhieu dong).
# Ly do 2: may khac clone ve co the KHONG bat core.autocrlf=true; luc do git
#          tra dung blob LF ra dia -> file .bat hong ngay tu dau.
# Ly do 3: nguoi dung tai CAP-NHAT.bat truc tiep qua raw.githubusercontent.com,
#          raw tra ve dung blob va bo qua moi cau hinh core.autocrlf cua may.
#
# Danh dau -text = git khong bao gio doi dau dong cua nhom file nay.
*.bat -text

# Cac file van ban khac cu de git tu chuan hoa nhu binh thuong.
*.py   text
*.md   text
*.json text
*.html text
*.css  text
*.js   text
